    "<entry>",
    "<id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/a0c327c0d7132f0033a20d423a85e2c922572c72</id>",
    "<link type=\"text/html\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://github.com/YukonWRB/YGwater/commit/a0c327c0d7132f0033a20d423a85e2c922572c72\"/>",
    "<title>",
    "Enhance discrete data handling and QA/QC integration",
    "</title>",
    "<updated>2026-09-04T16:22:59Z</updated>",
    "<media:thumbnail height=\"30\" width=\"30\" url=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91148465?s=30&amp;v=4\"/>",
    "<author>",
    "<name>gdelaplante</name>",
    "<uri>https://github.com/gdelaplante</uri>",
    "</author>",
    "<content type=\"html\">",
    "&lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Enhance discrete data handling and QA/QC integration",
    "- Updated SQL queries in discreteData.R to include sample qualifiers and result components for improved data retrieval.",
    "- Added new functions in discretePlot.R for handling result components and related QA/QC data.",
    "- Enhanced plotDiscrete function to support result component data in downloads and UI.",
    "- Modified module privilege requirements to include permissions for new discrete sample qualifiers and observers.",
    "- Updated snow course data retrieval to reflect new import source naming conventions.",
    "- Improved tests to cover new functionalities, including result component handling and privilege requirements for discrete administration.&lt;/pre&gt;",
    "</content>",
    "</entry>",
